    {
      "@id": "docs/guides/detangle.md#provenance-1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "detangle",
      "prov:value": "> **Folded into cat-harness 2026-09-23** (bean `byql`). This was the README of\n> a top-level `detangle/` instance that declared no `needs`, so its own edges\n> could not be placed by the direction classifier it hosts. The owner's ruling:\n> fold it into the harness. The script is\n> `skills/kg/graph-management/kg-detangle.ts`, beside the\n> [`graph-detanglement`](../../skills/kg/graph-management/graph-detanglement.md) skill\n> it implements (owner, 2026-09-24); the criterion `schemas/detangle.ts`; the\n> pinned measurements `test/results/detangle/`, under the declared `qa`\n> directory. Run it with `bun run cat kg:detangle`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean byql",
        "2026-09-23",
        "2026-09-24"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-09-23",
        "2026-09-24"
      ]
    },
    {
